<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine Siderar 1st half net 47.96 mln.</title>
<headline>Argentine Siderar 1st half net 47.96 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended Dec 31.</p>
<p>Net 47.96 million pesos vs 27.71 million pesos</p>
<p>Revs 513.51 million pesos vs n/a</p>
<p>Net assets 560.63 million pesos vs 495.90 million pesos.</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said it posted an extraordinary loss of 7.33 million pesos in the latest period.</p>
<p>Full company name is Siderar S.A.I.C.</p>
<p>((--Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0668))</p>
